IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sg-core`
IMPORT `sg-periods`
IMPORT `sgi-conversion`

-- Tests for sgi-conversion.l4 (ss 30, 31, 32). Expected values are written from the text beside each assertion.

§ `s 30(1) and (2)`

-- (1)(a): arguments: the members' liability; it was previously a limited company that became unlimited under (b).
#ASSERT `s 30(1)(a) the unlimited company may convert to a limited company` `unlimited` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30(1)(a) the unlimited company may convert to a limited company` `unlimited` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30(1)(a) the unlimited company may convert to a limited company` `limited by shares` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (1)(b): arguments: the members' liability; the 2 years of section 17(6) have expired; it was previously an unlimited company that became limited.
#ASSERT `s 30(1)(b) the limited company may convert to an unlimited company` `limited by shares` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30(1)(b) the limited company may convert to an unlimited company` `limited by guarantee` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30(1)(b) the limited company may convert to an unlimited company` `limited by shares` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30(1)(b) the limited company may convert to an unlimited company` `unlimited` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30(1)(b) the limited company may convert to an unlimited company` `limited by shares and by guarantee` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30(1)(b) the limited company may convert to an unlimited company` `limited by shares and by guarantee` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2): arguments: applied; lodged the prescribed documents; the registrable ones registered.
#ASSERT `s 30(2) the Registrar must issue to the company a notice of incorporation appropriate to the change of status` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30(2) the Registrar must issue to the company a notice of incorporation appropriate to the change of status` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(2) the Registrar must issue to the company a notice of incorporation appropriate to the change of status` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(2) the Registrar must issue to the company a notice of incorporation appropriate to the change of status` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Arguments: the notice has been issued; the day it was issued; the date asked.
#ASSERT `s 30(2) the company is deemed to be a company having the status specified in the notice` TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 10 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30(2) the company is deemed to be a company having the status specified in the notice` TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 9 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(2) the company is deemed to be a company having the status specified in the notice` FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 9 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (3): arguments: the status has been changed; the Registrar has directed a manner of publication.
#ASSERT `s 30(3) the notice of the change of status must be published` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30(3) the notice of the change of status must be published` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30(3) the notice of the change of status must be published` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (3A).
#ASSERT `s 30(3A) the Registrar must issue to the company a certificate confirming the incorporation with the new status` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30(3A) the Registrar must issue to the company a certificate confirming the incorporation with the new status` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(3A) the Registrar must issue to the company a certificate confirming the incorporation with the new status` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 30(4): the prescribed documents`

-- Arguments: an application by a limited company to convert to unlimited; the resolution resolves and specifies the status; it makes the alterations; it changes the name; the constitution is altered; a copy as altered is lodged; the assent of all members is lodged; the declaration is lodged.
#ASSERT `s 30(4) the documents lodged are the prescribed documents` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Unlimited to limited, no alteration to the constitution: no copy, assent or declaration is called for.
#ASSERT `s 30(4) the documents lodged are the prescribed documents` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- The constitution is altered but no copy as altered is lodged.
#ASSERT `s 30(4) the documents lodged are the prescribed documents` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Limited to unlimited without the assent, or without the declaration.
#ASSERT `s 30(4) the documents lodged are the prescribed documents` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(4) the documents lodged are the prescribed documents` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- A limb of paragraph (a) missing.
#ASSERT `s 30(4) the documents lodged are the prescribed documents` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(4) the documents lodged are the prescribed documents` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(4) the documents lodged are the prescribed documents` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 30(5) to (8)`

#ASSERT `s 30(5) section 26(2) to (6) applies to the matter` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(5) section 26(2) to (6) applies to the matter` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (6): arguments: passed for the purposes of an application; the notice has been issued; the day it was issued; the date asked.
#ASSERT `s 30(6) the special resolution has taken effect` TRUE TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 10 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30(6) the special resolution has taken effect` TRUE TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 9 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(6) the special resolution has taken effect` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 9 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(6) the special resolution has taken effect` FALSE TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (7): arguments: the resolution relates to a change of status; the provision is section 33(1).
#ASSERT `s 30(7) the provision of section 33 applies to the special resolution` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30(7) the provision of section 33 applies to the special resolution` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(7) the provision of section 33 applies to the special resolution` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (8): arguments: the status was changed pursuant to section 30; the matter.
#ASSERT `s 30(8) the change in status operates on the matter` TRUE `s 30(8)(a) the creation of a new legal entity` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(8) the change in status operates on the matter` TRUE `s 30(8)(b) the identity of the body corporate constituted by the company or its continuity as a body corporate` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(8) the change in status operates on the matter` TRUE `s 30(8)(c) the property, or the rights or obligations, of the company` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(8) the change in status operates on the matter` TRUE `s 30(8)(d) the validity of legal proceedings by or against the company` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 30(8) the change in status operates on the matter` TRUE `s 30(8) another matter` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30(8) the change in status operates on the matter` FALSE `s 30(8)(a) the creation of a new legal entity` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30(8) the legal proceedings may be continued or commenced by or against the company after the change in its status` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 30(8) the legal proceedings may be continued or commenced by or against the company after the change in its status` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 30(8) the legal proceedings may be continued or commenced by or against the company after the change in its status` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 31(1) to (3)`

-- (1): arguments: a public company having a share capital; the resolution copy; the constitution alteration; the list of persons holding shares; the other prescribed information.
#ASSERT `s 31(1) the public company may convert to a private company by lodging` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 31(1) the public company may convert to a private company by lodging` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 31(1) the public company may convert to a private company by lodging` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 31(1) the public company may convert to a private company by lodging` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 31(1) the public company may convert to a private company by lodging` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 31(1) the public company may convert to a private company by lodging` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2): arguments: a private company; its constitution does not bar the conversion; the resolution copy; the statement in lieu of prospectus; the declaration.
#ASSERT `s 31(2) the private company may convert to a public company by lodging` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 31(2) the private company may convert to a public company by lodging` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 31(2) the private company may convert to a public company by lodging` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 31(2) the private company may convert to a public company by lodging` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 31(2) the private company may convert to a public company by lodging` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 31(2) the private company may convert to a public company by lodging` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 31(2) the restrictions and limitations referred to in section 18(1) cease to form part of the constitution` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 31(2) the restrictions and limitations referred to in section 18(1) cease to form part of the constitution` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (3): arguments: complied with the subsection; the notice has been issued; the day it was issued; the date asked. These are the seam answers for the keel's s 4(1) "private company".
#ASSERT `s 31(3) the company has become a private company` TRUE TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 10 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 31(3) the company has become a private company` TRUE TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 9 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 31(3) the company has become a private company` FALSE TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 31(3) the company has become a private company` TRUE FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 11 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 31(3) the company has become a public company` TRUE TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 10 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 31(3) the company has become a public company` TRUE TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 9 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 31(3) the company has become a public company` FALSE TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 31(3A) to (5)`

-- (3A): the notice was issued on 1 March 2026; the 14 days after run to 15 March 2026 (P1: the day of the event is not counted).
-- Arguments: the company is the public company referred to; the day the notice was issued; the list is lodged; the day it was lodged; the date asked.
#ASSERT `s 31(3A) the company has complied with the duty to lodge the list of persons holding shares` TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 15 3 2026) (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 31(3A) the company has complied with the duty to lodge the list of persons holding shares` TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 16 3 2026) (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 31(3A) the company has complied with the duty to lodge the list of persons holding shares` TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 16 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 31(3A) the company has complied with the duty to lodge the list of persons holding shares` TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 15 3 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 31(3A) the company has complied with the duty to lodge the list of persons holding shares` FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 31(3A) the company must lodge the list of persons holding shares within 14 days` "Acme Ltd." AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Ltd." DOES `s 31(3A) lodge with the Registrar in the prescribed form a list of persons holding shares in the company` AT 14
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 31(3A) the company must lodge the list of persons holding shares within 14 days` "Acme Ltd." AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Ltd." DOES `s 31(3A) lodge with the Registrar in the prescribed form a list of persons holding shares in the company` AT 15
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 31(3A) the company must lodge the list of persons holding shares within 14 days` "Acme Ltd." AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 15)
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 31(3A) the company must lodge the list of persons holding shares within 14 days` "Acme Ltd." AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 14)
-- (4): arguments: converted pursuant to (1) or (2); the matter.
#ASSERT `s 31(4) the conversion affects the matter` TRUE `s 31(4)(a) the identity of the company` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 31(4) the conversion affects the matter` TRUE `s 31(4)(b) the rights or obligations of the company` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 31(4) the conversion affects the matter` TRUE `s 31(4)(c) the validity of legal proceedings by or against the company` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 31(4) the conversion affects the matter` TRUE `s 31(4) another matter` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 31(4) the conversion affects the matter` FALSE `s 31(4)(a) the identity of the company` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 31(4) the legal proceedings may be continued or commenced by or against the company after the conversion` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 31(4) the legal proceedings may be continued or commenced by or against the company after the conversion` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 31(4) the legal proceedings may be continued or commenced by or against the company after the conversion` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (5).
#ASSERT `s 31(5) the Registrar must issue to the company a certificate confirming the incorporation with the new status` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 31(5) the Registrar must issue to the company a certificate confirming the incorporation with the new status` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 31(5) the Registrar must issue to the company a certificate confirming the incorporation with the new status` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE

§ `s 32`

-- (2): arguments: default in complying with a limitation of s 18(1)(b); the constitution altered; ceased to have a share capital.
#ASSERT `s 32(2) the Registrar may by notice served on the company determine that it ceased to be a private company` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 32(2) the Registrar may by notice served on the company determine that it ceased to be a private company` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 32(2) the Registrar may by notice served on the company determine that it ceased to be a private company` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 32(2) the Registrar may by notice served on the company determine that it ceased to be a private company` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (3)(a) and (b): arguments: determined; the date specified in the order or notice; the date asked. These are the seam answers for the keel's s 4(1) "private company".
#ASSERT `s 32(3)(a) the company is a public company on and from the date specified` TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 10 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 32(3)(a) the company is a public company on and from the date specified` TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 9 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 32(3)(a) the company is a public company on and from the date specified` FALSE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 32(3)(b) the company is deemed to have changed its name by the omission of the word Private or Sendirian` TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 10 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 32(3)(b) the company is deemed to have changed its name by the omission of the word Private or Sendirian` TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 9 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 32(3)(b) the company is deemed to have changed its name by the omission of the word Private or Sendirian` FALSE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 11 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (3)(c): the order was made on 1 March 2026; the 14 days after run to 15 March 2026.
-- Arguments: determined; the day of the order or notice; both documents lodged; the day the lodging was completed; the date asked.
#ASSERT `s 32(3)(c) the company has complied with the duty to lodge the statement in lieu of prospectus and the declaration` TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 15 3 2026) (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 32(3)(c) the company has complied with the duty to lodge the statement in lieu of prospectus and the declaration` TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 16 3 2026) (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 32(3)(c) the company has complied with the duty to lodge the statement in lieu of prospectus and the declaration` TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 16 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 32(3)(c) the company has complied with the duty to lodge the statement in lieu of prospectus and the declaration` TRUE (Date 1 3 2026) FALSE (Date 1 1 2000) (Date 15 3 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 32(3)(c) the company has complied with the duty to lodge the statement in lieu of prospectus and the declaration` FALSE (Date 1 3 2026) TRUE (Date 10 3 2026) (Date 20 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- EXPECT FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 32(3)(c) the company must lodge the statement in lieu of prospectus and the declaration within 14 days` "Acme Ltd." AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Ltd." DOES `s 32(3)(c) lodge with the Registrar a statement in lieu of prospectus and a declaration in the prescribed form verifying that section 61(2)(b) has been complied with` AT 14
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 32(3)(c) the company must lodge the statement in lieu of prospectus and the declaration within 14 days` "Acme Ltd." AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company "Acme Ltd." DOES `s 32(3)(c) lodge with the Registrar a statement in lieu of prospectus and a declaration in the prescribed form verifying that section 61(2)(b) has been complied with` AT 15
-- EXPECT BREACH
#TRACE `s 32(3)(c) the company must lodge the statement in lieu of prospectus and the declaration within 14 days` "Acme Ltd." AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 15)
-- EXPECT RESIDUAL
#TRACE `s 32(3)(c) the company must lodge the statement in lieu of prospectus and the declaration within 14 days` "Acme Ltd." AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 14)
-- (4): arguments: a default or alteration referred to in (2) has occurred; the Court is satisfied of the excuse or that it is just and equitable; a failed gate at the Court's power answers JUST FALSE (S1b ruling, 2026S1bC).
#ASSERT `s 32(4) the Court may determine that the company has not ceased to be a private company` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 32(4) the Court may determine that the company has not ceased to be a private company` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 32(4) the Court may determine that the company has not ceased to be a private company` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- (5): arguments: became a public company by a determination; the Court has given permission.
#ASSERT `s 32(5) the company may not convert to a private company` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 32(5) the company may not convert to a private company` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 32(5) the company may not convert to a private company` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (6) and (8): the offences and their penalties.
#ASSERT `s 32(6) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 32(6) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 32(6) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 32(6) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST (Penalty OF 2000, 0, FALSE, TRUE)
#ASSERT `s 32(6) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 32(8) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 32(8) the person is guilty of the offence` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 32(8) the person is guilty of the offence` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 32(8) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST (Penalty OF 5000, 12, FALSE, FALSE)
#ASSERT `s 32(8) the most the person may be sentenced to on conviction` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
